cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the paper given under preferred-citation."
type: dataset
title: "NIC Physics-of-Failure Run-to-Failure Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Hourly run-to-failure trajectories for 200 simulated server-class network
  interface cards (NICs) in hot, cold and air-conditioned environments,
  generated with a physics-of-failure model covering electromigration,
  time-dependent dielectric breakdown, thermally activated aging and
  solder-joint thermal-cycling fatigue. The dataset includes failure times,
  right-censoring, path-aware and constant-rate remaining-useful-life labels,
  and the complete generation configuration.
